+// Story 033, task 8.2 — what the frozen `devtools_delivery_tests.rs` cannot reach:
+//   - R9.11: an insertion that fails after the answer went out is shown as a notification in the
+//     target window; only the `FailInsertion` seam can make insertion fail once the window
+//     resolves.
+//   - fix cycle 1: a conversation that failed to load gets a new thread (M1); a terminal as the
+//     panel's new entry does not take the view from the new thread (M2); after a wait, a user who
+//     moved to another window is not pulled back (M3).
+// The inner `mod insert` keeps the paths reading `…::insert::…`, and the module name keeps them
+// under `cargo test -p agent_ui devtools_delivery`.
+
+use std::any::Any;
+use std::path::Path;
